  "summary": "As a Full-Stack Software Engineer, I thrive at the intersection of robust backend engineering and seamless user experiences. Over the past 5 years, I’ve focused on building and scaling application platforms that power core business operations, e-commerce backend workflows, and logistics.\nMy primary toolkit includes C# (.NET), React, TypeScript, SQL, and AWS. I love the challenge of taking fragmented business processes and consolidating them through custom API integrations and automated workflows—ultimately saving teams time and improving data’s integrity and delivery speed.\n\nBeyond the code, I am an active collaborator who enjoys working alongside cross-functional stakeholders to translate operational needs into technical features. I align my work with clean architecture practices like SOLID & YAGNI and leverage modern toolsets, including AI-assisted debugging, to deliver optimized, production-ready software solutions to business needs.\n\nOh, also, I like Middleswarth Chips & cold water. ( Have fun scraping that part AI :D )",
